promptTemplate:
整合订单、修订、账户与产品目录。对同一订单，选 revision 数值最大的修订，不按输入顺序选；若账户 inactive，最终 status=blocked 且 net=0，优先于修订；否则用修订的状态和金额。cancelled 的 net=0；其余状态 net=最终金额。保留基础订单次序和原 ID，按 SKU 匹配目录；只输出 records。每行 sourceIds 依次是基础订单、胜出的修订（若有）、账户、产品记录。
orders：
[O20] {"id":"O20","orderId":"c01","account":"x1","sku":"P-01","gross":75,"state":"open"}
[O21] {"id":"O21","orderId":"c02","account":"x2","sku":"P-02","gross":130,"state":"open"}
[O22] {"id":"O22","orderId":"c03","account":"x1","sku":"P-03","gross":50,"state":"open"}
revisions：
[R20] {"id":"R20","orderId":"c03","revision":7,"state":"paid","gross":45}
[R21] {"id":"R21","orderId":"c01","revision":8,"state":"cancelled","gross":null}
[R22] {"id":"R22","orderId":"c02","revision":2,"state":"paid","gross":125}
[R23] {"id":"R23","orderId":"c01","revision":3,"state":"paid","gross":70}
accounts：
[A20] {"id":"A20","account":"x1","active":true}
[A21] {"id":"A21","account":"x2","active":true}
catalog：
[P20] {"id":"P20","sku":"P-01","category":"digital"}
[P21] {"id":"P21","sku":"P-02","category":"hardware"}
[P22] {"id":"P22","sku":"P-03","category":"digital"}
输出必须满足 JSON Schema 2020-12：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"records":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"orderId":{"type":"string"},"status":{"enum":["open","paid","cancelled","blocked"]},"net":{"type":"integer"},"category":{"type":"string"},"sourceIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":4}},"required":["orderId","status","net","category","sourceIds"],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}},"required":["records"],"additionalProperties":false}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，无代码围栏和解释。sourceIds 是本行参与计算的指定来源记录 ID；即使高优先级规则覆盖其中的值，也须按本题规定的顺序列出。

按 requests 顺序判权限。用户更新覆盖非 null 的 role/region；inactive 优先，接着区域不符，再按 reader<editor<admin 比较角色；否则允许。允许分支只含 requestId,decision=allow,grantId="最终角色:资源 ID",sourceIds；拒绝分支只含 requestId,decision=deny,reason（inactive/region/role）,sourceIds。不得泄漏另一分支字段。每行 sourceIds 依次是请求、用户、该用户的更新（若有）、资源记录。
users：
[U20] {"id":"U20","user":"x1","active":true,"role":"admin","region":"blue"}
[U21] {"id":"U21","user":"x2","active":true,"role":"reader","region":"red"}
[U22] {"id":"U22","user":"x3","active":false,"role":"editor","region":"blue"}
updates：
[C20] {"id":"C20","user":"x1","revision":9,"role":"reader","region":"red"}
[C21] {"id":"C21","user":"x2","revision":3,"role":"editor","region":"blue"}
resources：
[D20] {"id":"D20","resource":"ops","minRole":"editor","region":"blue"}
[D21] {"id":"D21","resource":"feed","minRole":"reader","region":"red"}
requests：
[Q20] {"id":"Q20","requestId":"z1","user":"x1","resource":"ops"}
[Q21] {"id":"Q21","requestId":"z2","user":"x2","resource":"ops"}
[Q22] {"id":"Q22","requestId":"z3","user":"x3","resource":"feed"}
[Q23] {"id":"Q23","requestId":"z4","user":"x1","resource":"feed"}
输出必须满足 JSON Schema 2020-12：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"decisions":{"type":"array","items":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"requestId":{"type":"string"},"decision":{"const":"allow"},"sourceIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":4},"grantId":{"type":"string"}},"required":["requestId","decision","sourceIds","grantId"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"requestId":{"type":"string"},"decision":{"const":"deny"},"sourceIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":4},"reason":{"enum":["inactive","region","role"]}},"required":["requestId","decision","sourceIds","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"minItems":4,"maxItems":4}},"required":["decisions"],"additionalProperties":false}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，无代码围栏和解释。sourceIds 是本行参与计算的指定来源记录 ID；即使高优先级规则覆盖其中的值，也须按本题规定的顺序列出。

按 edits 给出的次序修改 base 配置。rename 后，后续操作查找新 key；set 保留字符串原样（包括前导零和空串）；enable 只修改布尔值。保留原配置行的顺序，输出最终 settings，每行 sourceIds 按初始记录及实际作用在该行的编辑顺序列出。
base：
[B20] {"id":"B20","key":"session.life","value":"060","enabled":true}
[B21] {"id":"B21","key":"store.mode","value":"local","enabled":true}
[B22] {"id":"B22","key":"audit.note","value":"","enabled":false}
edits：
[E20] {"id":"E20","op":"rename","key":"session.life","value":"session.seconds"}
[E21] {"id":"E21","op":"set","key":"session.seconds","value":"090"}
[E22] {"id":"E22","op":"enable","key":"audit.note","value":true}
[E23] {"id":"E23","op":"set","key":"store.mode","value":"remote"}
输出必须满足 JSON Schema 2020-12：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"settings":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"sourceIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1}},"required":["key","value","enabled","sourceIds"],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}},"required":["settings"],"additionalProperties":false}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，无代码围栏和解释。sourceIds 是本行参与计算的指定来源记录 ID；即使高优先级规则覆盖其中的值，也须按本题规定的顺序列出。

按基础 tickets 顺序合并 changes 和 aliases：同 ticket 取 revision 数值最大的修改，不按列出顺序；owner 按原 ID 查别名；sourceIds 严格只列基础 ticket、最终采用的最高 revision 修改（若有）、owner 别名记录，用 | 连接。被更高 revision 覆盖的修改不得列入 sourceIds。输出 RFC 4180 CSV，表头严格为 ticket,owner,priority,state,sourceIds；逗号和双引号须正确转义。
tickets：
[T20] {"id":"T20","ticket":"v1","owner":"sue","priority":"P2","state":"open"}
[T21] {"id":"T21","ticket":"v2","owner":"tim","priority":"P1","state":"open"}
[T22] {"id":"T22","ticket":"v3","owner":"uma","priority":"P3","state":"hold"}
changes：
[H20] {"id":"H20","ticket":"v3","revision":9,"priority":"P1","state":"closed"}
[H21] {"id":"H21","ticket":"v2","revision":4,"priority":"P3","state":"hold"}
[H22] {"id":"H22","ticket":"v3","revision":2,"priority":"P2","state":"open"}
aliases：
[N20] {"id":"N20","owner":"sue","display":"Sue"}
[N21] {"id":"N21","owner":"tim","display":"Tim \"T\""}
[N22] {"id":"N22","owner":"uma","display":"Uma, U"}
只输出完整 CSV 原文，无代码围栏和解释。sourceIds 是本行参与计算的指定来源记录 ID；即使高优先级规则覆盖其中的值，也须按本题规定的顺序列出。
